<title>FRANCE: Valeo has 12.8 pct first half profit rise.</title>
<headline>Valeo has 12.8 pct first half profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half results to June 30 (In millions of francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable profit	    740    vs    656</p>
<p>    Net profit			     774    vs    669</p>
<p>    Pre-tax pre-exceptional profit  1,118   vs    980</p>
<p>    Gross margin			  3,469   vs  3,020</p>
<p>    Cash flow			     1,819   vs  1,580</p>
<p>    Sales				  17,260   vs 15,060</p>
<p>    Financial debt			  808   vs    673</p>
<p>NOTE - Valeo gave the figures in a statement. The debt figure for 1996 was at end-December</p>
</text>
